<title>MALAYSIA: Hong Leong Credit 6-mth net up 34 pct.</title>
<headline>Hong Leong Credit 6-mth net up 34 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to Dec 31, 96</p>
<p>		     (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)    37.1	  vs	  27.6</p>
<p>    Net profit	    127.50	 vs	  94.83</p>
<p>    Turnover	    1,021.08	 vs	 632.92</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	261.61	 vs	 194.97</p>
<p>    Minorities    (less) 53.33	 vs (less) 41.72</p>
<p>    Dividend (pct)	  6.0	  vs	   6.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Hong Leong Credit Bhd is engaged in property investment, banking and other financial services.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
</text>
